  <uml:Model xmi:id="model.library-fines" name="Library fines">
    <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="model.library-fines.comment">
      <body>Fines the library issues on late, damaged or lost loans: a member pays or disputes, a librarian upholds or waives. It shares the Loan and Member classes with the library-loan workflow, so PlayIDE draws the two as one system.</body>
    </ownedComment>
